        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/bgm/SCM16-2.5> ;
    ipbes:Report <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/SCM16> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Many relevant methods and tools are available, but they should be matched carefully with the needs of any given assessment or decision support activity, and applied with care, taking into account uncertainties and unpredictability associated with model-based projections." ;
    dcterms:identifier "High-level message 2" .

