<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333079/items/ZZD4GH6D> a ipbes:Reference ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/SCM16ch4> ;
    ipbes:Report <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/SCM16> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/SCM16-4.2> ;
